I will be waiting for you 
forever at the end of time.

00:17:10.720 --> 00:17:12.640
Before I am ready,

00:17:12.640 --> 00:17:15.430
life has changed.

00:17:16.180 --> 00:17:18.310
I'm confused at the crossroad,

00:17:18.310 --> 00:17:20.720
wondering which way is home.

00:17:21.720 --> 00:17:23.720
My birthday wishes,

00:17:23.720 --> 00:17:27.270
did anyone hear them this time?

00:17:27.270 --> 00:17:29.270
Keep my words to myself,

00:17:29.270 --> 00:17:31.470
and my memories float in the starry sky.

00:17:32.060 --> 00:17:34.720
Occasionally I feel depressed.

00:17:34.720 --> 00:17:37.560
Occasionally I feel sad.

00:17:37.560 --> 00:17:42.520
Who knows the weakness behind my smile?

00:17:43.140 --> 00:17:45.140
Mom said that time

00:17:45.140 --> 00:17:47.930
once roared like a wind.

00:17:47.930 --> 00:17:50.600
Feel your hopes.

00:17:50.600 --> 00:17:53.770
Look forward to beautiful.

00:17:54.850 --> 00:17:59.060
This power comes because 
we have each other around.

00:17:59.060 --> 00:18:01.680
Even if the world before me

00:18:01.680 --> 00:18:05.310
will change or drift away,

00:18:05.970 --> 00:18:10.270
I will be waiting for you 
forever at the end of time.

00:18:11.350 --> 00:18:16.270
I will be waiting for you 
forever at the end of time.
